### Get all movies
GET http://localhost:3000/movies

### Get one existing movie
GET http://localhost:3000/movies/1

### Get a missing movie
GET http://localhost:3000/movies/999

### Create a valid movie
POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Arrival",
  "year": 2016,
  "genre": "Sci-Fi"
}

### Create an invalid movie (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "year": "not a number"
}

### Replace a movie with PUT (all fields required)
PUT http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inception: Updated Edition",
  "year": 2010,
  "genre": "Sci-Fi"
}

### Invalid incomplete PUT (400)
PUT http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Incomplete replacement"
}

### Partially update a movie with PATCH
PATCH http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2011
}

### Invalid PATCH value (400)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 12
}

### Filter by genre
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?genre=sci-fi

### Filter by minimum year
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?minYear=2000

### Combine filters and sort
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?genre=Sci-Fi&minYear=2000&sort=year

### Sort alphabetically by title
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?sort=title

### Invalid minimum year (400)
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?minYear=invalid

### Invalid sort value (400)
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?sort=rating

### Delete an existing movie (204, empty response)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/movies/1

### Delete the same movie again (404)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/movies/1

### Unknown route (404 ROUTE_NOT_FOUND)
GET http://localhost:3000/does-not-exist
